  "body_html": "<h1>Utility Representation</h1>\n<p>A utility function $u$ represents a preference relation if it preserves and\nreflects weak preference:\n$$\n  x \\le y \\quad\\text{if and only if}\\quad u(x)\\le u(y).\n$$</p>\n<p>Consequently, the same utility representation also preserves strict preference\nand indifference.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MSZ, Chapter 2, Def. 2.7] Maschler, Solan, and Zamir, <em>Game Theory</em>, <code>references/GameTheory.pdf</code>. Utility function represents a preference relation.</li>\n</ul>",
